ry","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":119,"yt":null,"src":"ensayos"}],"member_of":[],"genres":[],"album_genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","n":2},{"id":185670346256268,"type":"genre","name":"rock","n":2},{"id":109063683126539,"type":"genre","name":"Hard Rock","n":2},{"id":31482837869539,"type":"genre","name":"Punk","n":2},{"id":226054802434556,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Punk","n":1},{"id":93579530230421,"type":"genre","name":"Gothic Rock","n":1},{"id":15906669628272,"type":"genre","name":"Jangle Pop","n":1}],"labels":[],"album_labels":[],"own_scenes":[],"scenes":[],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Early Discrepancies (1993)","body":"The band's eventual separation began earlier than generally perceived, with issues surfacing around their 1993 album, \"El Espíritu del Vino.\" Interviews from that period already revealed stylistic discrepancies among the members, indicating internal problems. \"Porque ya con el espíritu del vino, al que el disco que había sacado en 1993, la cosa ya no iba bien del todo.\"","year":1993,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"National Commotion from Separation (1995)","body":"The band's separation in 1995, which occurred mid-tour for their \"Avalancha\" album, caused a national commotion in Spain. The news was widely reported, and people openly cried, treating it as a public spectacle. \"Pero la verdad es que fue como una comocción nacional aquí en España cuando se paran los seres del silencio.\"","year":1995,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"South American Legacy (1996)","body":"In the mid-90s, the band's legacy remained active in South America, with a release (referred to ambiguously as \"entibian plaque\") coming out in 1996, indicating that fans were still processing their breakup and the band's output was still relevant. \"la mitad de suroamérica había sacado el entibian plaque en el 96.\"","year":1996,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Lingering Public Grief (1997)","body":"Even by 1997, when Bunbury released his first solo album, the public was still mourning the separation of Héroes del Silencio and had not fully come to terms with it. Their previous album, \"Avalancha,\" was still on sales charts in Spain at the time. \"Porque salía en 1997, la gente estuvo mucho tiempo llorando como la separación del silencio, como que como que aún no lo había sumido.\"","year":1997,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Exhausting \"El Espíritu del Vino\" Tour","body":"The tour supporting \"El Espíritu del Vino\" was exceptionally long and contentious, causing the band members to become thoroughly jaded and leading to numerous disputes, especially during their months-long touring in South America. \"La gira del espíritu del vino fue como muy, muy larga y como muy con bússa.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Immense Spanish Pressure","body":"Héroes del Silencio faced an \"insane\" level of pressure in Spain, and the Spanish-speaking world generally, to maintain and surpass their quality. They were so important and acclaimed in Spain that this pressure sometimes became unhealthy. \"Sí que es verdad que posiblemente tenía una presión insana dentro de España, en el mundo en español es general, pero sobre todo en España hacía la calidad y la superación.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Post-Tour Crisis","body":"Following the extensive \"El Espíritu del Vino\" tour, the band entered a period of crisis marked by significant disagreements among members regarding the future creative direction of Héroes del Silencio. \"Y después justo de esa larguísima gira, la banda tiene ahí como ese momento de crisis en el que...\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Music Radar Clan","episode":"BUNBURY encontrando su camino","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XztHAndjmsw"}]}],"awards":[{"kind":"award","title":"Premios Ondas (1995) — Iberia sumergida","body":"Won.","year":1995,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q786357"}]},{"kind":"award","title":"Latin Grammy Award for Best Rock Vocal Album, Duo or Group (2008) — Tour 2007","body":"Nominated.","year":2008,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Wikidata","episode":null,"url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q6496382"}]}],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":219896046969372,"type":"album","name":"El mar no cesa","list_id":161051722508702,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Jangle Pop","src":"musthear","rank":137,"year":1988,"note":null,"yt":"TyBYg7zEaXA","scaruffi":null},{"id":134582911135576,"type":"song","name":"Flor venenosa","work_year":1989,"list_id":162234303830440,"list":"Los 40 nº1 · 1989","src":"singles","rank":18,"year":1989,"note":"","yt":"sxV0FQvemvI","scaruffi":null},{"id":57371732001709,"type":"album","name":"Senderos de Traicion","list_id":242669898096444,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Gothic Rock","src":"musthear","rank":34,"year":1990,"note":null,"yt":"6wYyjRGX7AE","scaruffi":null},{"id":57371732001709,"type":"album","name":"Senderos de Traicion","list_id":182218712006755,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk","src":"musthear","rank":137,"year":1990,"note":null,